    },
    {
      "id": "p-diff",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "text": "Exactly as in the half adder, the difference bit is 1 when the inputs differ: "
        },
        {
          "text": "DIFF = A XOR B",
          "marks": [
            {
              "kind": "code"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "h-borrow",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "text": "BORROW needs an inverter"
    },
    {
      "id": "p-borrow",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "text": "You borrow only when subtracting 1 from 0, so "
        },
        {
          "text": "BORROW = (NOT A) AND B",
          "marks": [
            {
              "kind": "code"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ". This is the one asymmetry with the half adder, whose carry is a plain "
        },
        {
          "text": "A AND B",
          "marks": [
            {
              "kind": "code"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " with no inversion."
        }
      ]
    },
